{"id":"1998095610671297880","kind":"article","title":"RenderMan 的销售额对皮克斯的业务可能并不重要","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zTXimXrTsccVtL8aKZW2MgZ"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2026-01-23","updated":"2026-01-23","votes":4,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":428,"keywords":["皮克斯","RenderMan","研发投入","技术战略","商业模式"],"summary":"短文引用皮克斯 2005 年报告：软件收入约占总收入 5%，而技术研发成本约占运营费用 40% 至 50%。作者据此提醒，至少在历史上，技术对皮克斯更像重要成本中心，而非直接的销售收入来源；分析其电影与技术飞轮时应记住这点。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1998095610671297880","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"nJhdoaQp\">Disney 于 2006 年收购了皮克斯，自 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1002114/000119312506047278/d10k.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2005 年的 10-K 年度报告</a>以来，便未再报告过其技术销售的收入。在那一年，皮克斯报告称其软件收入约占总收入的 5%。该数字当时并未增长：在 2003 至 2005 年期间大致持平。与此同时，在这一时期，技术研发成本却占到了皮克斯总运营费用的 40-50%。</p><p data-pid=\"LlUPOpiz\">因此至少从历史上看，技术是皮克斯的一个重大成本中心。在思考<a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-title=\"皮克斯的电影与技术发展互为联动飞轮\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zB7bdhotesiTDgSjHwGr9i4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">皮克斯的电影与技术发展互为联动飞轮</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>时，牢记这一点非常重要。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"qHmu-hjS\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1996639927711057312\" href=\"#/post/1996639927711057312\">皮克斯的电影与技术发展互为联动飞轮</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"LmxKl2KQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-3-pro-preview，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-title=\"RenderMan sales are probably not important to Pixar’s business\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zTXimXrTsccVtL8aKZW2MgZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">RenderMan sales are probably not important to Pixar’s business</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 皮克斯的电影与技术发展互为联动飞轮 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1996639927711057312\" href=\"#/post/1996639927711057312\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"1996642328971081633","title":"杜比实验室","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"1996639927711057312","title":"皮克斯的电影与技术发展互为联动飞轮","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"654015032","title":"§公司研究实验室的实践","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}